  "description": "In a kingdom rotting from within, Rey, an Arcanist whose magic serves the city's power players, scrapes by in a dusty bookstore with one-night stands as his only relief. After one intense night with two men, one of them won’t leave. Behind his refined mask lies a decadent hunger — and Rey knows it's poison, but he can't stay away.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
